     <http://bird-bird_formula_1-ontology-20260809-235138/ontology/vkg-bird_formula_1/Race/raceid> ?rid .
  ?lt a <http://bird-bird_formula_1-ontology-20260809-235138/ontology/vkg-bird_formula_1/LapTime> ;
